text = "This game is all about timing and reaction, as well as precise positioning.

-> To swing your sword, press the space bar or click with your mouse. It swings in a 120 degree arc and will instantly destroy any arrows in its path.

-> The sword will swing in the direction of your mouse. Therefore, positioning your cursor is important.

Win condition:
On both levels, survive for 60 seconds. Dying will reset all progress. (If you are hit once, you die).

The sword/bar on your right indicates STAMINA. Every time you swing your sword, your STAMINA decreases. If the STAMINA bar is too low, you will not be able to swing your sword until it regnerates. (It fills up over time)

IMPORTANT: The screen will flash red before a large wave of arrows."
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_ojehl")
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

